 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official Amazon WorkSpaces Thin Client API (2023-08-22). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. Environments are configuration metadata: no device is activated, registered or updated and no activation code is issued, so registeredDevicesCount stays 0. Devices and software sets are not implemented: GetDevice, ListDevices, DeregisterDevice, ListSoftwareSets and UpdateSoftwareSet return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501. desktopArn must be a WorkSpaces directory, WorkSpaces Applications stack or WorkSpaces Secure Browser portal ARN; desktopType is derived from it, but the desktop and its endpoint are neither looked up nor contacted. desiredSoftwareSetId and the USE_DESIRED update mode are refused because no software set exists; KMS keys are stored without resolving them. CUSTOM maintenance windows require start and end hours and minutes. Delete client tokens are accepted but not recorded. SDK clients must disable host-prefix injection (botocore inject_host_prefix=False) because the official api. host prefix cannot address the loopback endpoint.",
  "title": "Amazon WorkSpaces Thin Client (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "2023-08-22"
 },
